Package: qcurs
Type: Package
Title: Quality Control for Urban Temperature Sensor Networks
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Patrick", "Kallabis", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "patrick.kallabis@unibe.ch")
Description: Quality-control chain for urban low-cost temperature and relative humidity
    networks, levels T_QC_1 to T_QC_8 plus optional
    linear gap interpolation (T_QC_9). Standardised input handling via
    qc_prepare_input(), documented flag codes (0 unobjected, N objected by
    level N, 50/50+N interpolated), honest refusals where the data cannot
    support a test, and corrected neighbour selection, thresholds and NA
    handling relative to the published pipeline of Amini et al. (2026),
    Scientific Data 13:658.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    xts,
    zoo,
    geosphere,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
